I haven't tried it (because it changes the game more than what I like),
but just a small notice from reading it:
The patch will invalidate existing bones and save files because you added
the trap_on_top flag to struct flag. If it were in struct instance_flags
instead, it wouldn't affect file compatibility.
The flags in instance_flags are not saved in the save file, the game only
reads them from the configuration file and, depending on the optflags
defined in options.c, they may be settable with the O command from within
the game.

